koz VM : closures, shared variables and nesting finkoz

koz the inner function updates a variable of its parent finkoz
zafer compteur(depa)
ouver
    keksoz total idon depa
    zafer ajoute(n)
    ouver
        total idon total èk n
        ran total
    fèrm
    afise(ajoute(1))
    afise(ajoute(2))
    ran ajoute(10)
fèrm
afise(compteur(100))

koz the parent sees the change made by the inner function finkoz
zafer parent()
ouver
    keksoz v idon 1
    zafer change()
    ouver
        v idon 5
    sétou
    change()
    ran v
fèrm
afise(parent())

koz a variable captured through two levels of functions finkoz
zafer externe(x)
ouver
    zafer milye()
    ouver
        zafer enteryè()
        ouver
            ran x èk 1
        fèrm
        ran enteryè()
    fèrm
    ran milye()
fèrm
afise(externe(41))
